abstract: >
  ToxBads is a structured collection of published clinical case reports
  and case series related to toxicity of biologically active dietary
  supplements (BADS / nutraceuticals), with an interactive Streamlit
  prototype for search and case browsing.
keywords:
  - dietary supplements
  - nutraceuticals
  - toxicity
  - case reports
  - hepatotoxicity
  - pharmacovigilance
  - ToxBads
